The law texts in this repository are official texts of Zenica-Doboj Canton (Zeničko-dobojski kanton), Federation of Bosnia
and Herzegovina, taken from the official gazette Službene novine Zeničko-dobojskog kantona as published on the
Canton's website, https://zdk.ba/ (consulted 2026-10-30).

They are not protected by copyright. Zakon o autorskom i srodnim pravima (Službeni glasnik BiH 63/10), član 8
("Nezaštićene tvorevine"), stav (1): "Autorskopravno nisu zaštićeni: [...] b) službeni tekstovi iz oblasti
zakonodavstva, uprave i sudstva (zakoni, uredbe, odluke, izvještaji, zapisnici, sudske odluke i slično)". (Official
texts in legislation, administration and the judiciary - laws, decrees, decisions, reports, minutes, court decisions
and the like - are not protected by copyright.)

Source: Zeničko-dobojski kanton, Službene novine Zeničko-dobojskog kantona, https://zdk.ba/.

This repository is not an official publication; the binding text is the one published in the official gazette,
Službene novine Zeničko-dobojskog kantona.

Lexifina's own contributions (the arrangement of the history, the commit messages, the tables and the tools) are
dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
